</Value>
    </expertiseList>
    <grid>
      <Value>
{"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockGrid":[{"contentUdi":"umb://element/5de0c619fe624decac349d91ecf8dcc0","areas":[],"columnSpan":12,"rowSpan":1}]},"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"9a4f7c2e-1b3d-4e8a-bf01-7d62a8f5c930","udi":"umb://element/5de0c619fe624decac349d91ecf8dcc0","content":"\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/avkm1cyu/gif-1.gif\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eON-SITE ASSESSMENTS\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cem\u003eHave a Concrete Technologist visit your site.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe can assess your works and provide practical, economical recommendations suited to you. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eIf necessary, we can also guide a team to resolve any issues that arise from simple or complex failures.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/oiwjfokl/hardened-concrete.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHARDENED CONCRETE EVALUATIONS\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cem\u003eAssess your hardened concrete.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe can assess reinforcing depth and the many critical aspects affecting the strength of hardened concrete.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eCover Surveys, Half-Cell Potential, Reinforcement Diameter, Reinforcement mapping, Crack Measurement, Rebound Hammer\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/demp0h4n/gif-2.gif\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUNDERGROUND SERVICE MAPPING\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cem\u003eSee into the ground beneath your feet.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGet detailed maps showing storm water pipes, drains, sewers, electrical lines, fibre lines and voids underneath construction sites and earthworks.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eGS8000, GP8000 Ground Penetrating Radar.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/orhbkftb/wet-concrete.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWET CONCRETE SERVICES \u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cem\u003eUnique mix designs and services.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe can create unique concrete mix designs and monitor the hydration and changing temperature of cementitious materials in a concrete mixture.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eConcrete Mix Designs, Heat of Hydration Monitoring.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/r3lgg2bm/gif-3.gif\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eASSESSMENTS OF STRUCTURES\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cem\u003eGet deep insight into your structures.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe can reveal and assess cracks, voids and other integrity issues in large structures comprising a range of materials.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cem\u003eGS8000, GP8000 Ground Penetrating Radar.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/zscirqla/img-95c296bf.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePULL OFF AND PULL OUT TESTING\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cem\u003eAffordable, convenient and definitive.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe offer these two critical tests for assessing the quality of installation at affordable rates across SA.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003ePull off testing of screed, epoxy and coatings,\u003cbr /\u003ePull out testing of chemical anchors and fixings.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/mwni3ez0/gif-5.gif\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eREBAR MAPPING \u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cem\u003eWork with confidence.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUsing augmented reality we can reveal rebar and other subsurface elements in concrete floors, walls and more.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eUltrasonic Pulse Echo, Ultrasonic Pulse Velocity.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/jmqkuc2n/drone-surveys.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDRONE SURVEYS\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cem\u003eSee more than ever before.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGet accurate topographical maps and 3D models of areas and structures using LIDAR technology. \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eLiDAR Surveys, Thermal Industrial Inspections, Topographic Surveys, Stockpile Surveys.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/n0nnbyfa/gif-4.gif\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSCREED TESTING\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cem\u003eMap out delamination in detail.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe can reliably and confidently assess if your screed is adequately compacted and determine the probable performance in use. \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eBRE Screed Testing.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/qvskdkho/upe.png\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSUB-SURFACE SCANNING\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cem\u003eGet a detailed look into built structures.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe can reveal reinforcing, pre and post-tension cables and other subsurface elements in concrete.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eUltrasonic Pulse Echo, Ultrasonic Pulse Velocity.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInterested in our work?\u003c/strong\u003e Reach out to us at 066 299 1985 or fill out the form below.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}],"settingsData":[]}
</Value>
    </grid>
    <heroContent>
      <Value><![CDATA[<p>Our Concrete Technologist is ready to assess your needs or arrange a site visit.<br /><strong>Simply fill out the form below or call 082 310 5073.<br /></strong></p>
<p>Our non-destructive scanning services provide you with unparalleled insight into your structures, facilities and the ground beneath your feet.</p>]]></Value>
    </heroContent>
